  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### View SA302 Computation\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at 11:57 AM\n\n\t\t - \n### Location:  Capium > Self Assessment > SA100 > Client Specific > Reports > SA302 Computation\n\n###  \nBy Clicking on the second button named View SA302 Computation a Dialogue Box named Tax Calculation (for the concerned year) can be seen. \n\n### The Screenshot Below will help:\n\n### \n\n### \n\n### A PDF of the Tax Calculation can be downloaded by clicking on the Icon listed on the Upper left corner of the Pop-Up as highlighted in the red box.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
